Volto 19 support. The `@plone/volto` peer dependency range changed from `>=16.0.0-alpha.38` to `^19.0.0`, so projects on earlier Volto versions must stay on the 4.x line. The repository is a pnpm monorepo and the add-on moved to `packages/volto-subsites`; the Yarn and npm lock files were replaced by pnpm (`pnpm-lock.yaml`, `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, `packageManager: pnpm@10.20.0`), so the development workflow is now `pnpm install`, `pnpm start`, `pnpm test`, and `pnpm build`.
